# Optional: YouTube Data API v3 key, so search also shows YouTube songs.
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in (never commit .env.local).
# Without it, people can still paste their own key in the app (Library → Settings).
# Restrict the key in Google Cloud: Application restrictions → Websites → your domain,
# API restrictions → YouTube Data API v3.
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
